    <briefdescription>
<para>Custom deleter for <ref refid="classcslt_1_1ArenaAllocator" kindref="compound">ArenaAllocator</ref> unique pointers. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This deleter properly cleans up <ref refid="classcslt_1_1ArenaAllocator" kindref="compound">ArenaAllocator</ref> instances created by factory methods (Heap, Stack, SubArena). It:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Calls the arena&apos;s destructor (frees additional chunks)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Frees the base memory only if the arena owns it (DYNAMIC only)</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>Memory ownership:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>DYNAMIC (Heap): Owns memory → frees with ::operator delete</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>STATIC (Stack): User owns buffer → doesn&apos;t free</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>SUB (SubArena): Parent owns memory → doesn&apos;t free </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
